#Data Arrangement:
#For the 4x4 tables, each starting pair needs its own table.
#This is the AU table:  
#			5' --> 3'      
#			    AX
#			    UY
#			3' <-- 5'   
#			    Y->          
#	   	---------------------------- 
#	(X) 	A	C	G	U	1  
#	 | 	----------------------------
#	 V   
#A	-0.8	-1.0	-0.8	-1.0	-1.0
#C	-0.6	-0.7	-0.6	-0.7	-0.7
#G	-0.8	-1.0	-0.8	-1.0	-1.0
#U	-0.6	-0.8	-0.6	-0.8	-1.5	
#1	-0.6	-0.8	-0.6	-1.5	-1.5	

#An energy of "." is "infinity," i.e. not allowed.


#		5' --> 3'
		   AX
		   UY
#		3' <-- 5'
#		    Y 
# 	---------------------------- 
	A	C	G	U	1    
# 	----------------------------  
A	-0.8	-1.0	-0.8	-1.0	-1.0
C	-0.6	-0.7	-0.6	-0.7	-0.9
G	-0.8	-1.0	-0.8	-1.0	-1.0
U	-0.6	-0.8	-0.6	-0.8	-1.1	
1	-0.6	-1.3	-0.6	-1.2	-1.1


#		5' --> 3'
		   AX
		   1Y
#		3' <-- 5'
#		    Y 
